  "text": "## Template 2: Interest Payment Notification  \n**Subject:** Your Monthly Interest Payment — £[amount]  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nGreat news! Your monthly interest has been added to your account.\n\nInterest Details:\n- Amount: £[amount]\n- Calculation: [Balance] × 4.50% AER ÷ 365 × [days]\n- Effective Date: [date]\n- New Balance: £[new balance]\n\nYour Current Rate: 4.50% AER (applies to balances £0–£10,000)\n\nIf you'd like to increase your rate, consider depositing more:\n- Balances £10,001–£50,000: 4.70% AER\n- Balances £50,001+: 4.80% AER\n\nView Your Account:\nLog in at www.firstuk.bank/login to see your updated balance\nand transaction history.\n\nQuestions about your interest? Contact us anytime:\n- Phone: 0800-555-2265\n- Email: support@firstuk.bank\n\nThank you for banking with us!\n\nFirstUK Bank Team\n```  \n---",
